            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 16:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.8.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 8:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 9:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Herode, mfalume wa jimbo ra Galilaya, wasikira mambo higa gosi, kpwa vira dzina ra Jesu kala rikaenea chila phatu. Atu anjina kala achiamba, “Johana Mʼbatizadzi akafufuka! Ndiyo mana anaweza kuhenda vilinje vinji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anjina kala achiamba, “Mutu hiyu ni Elija.” Anjina nao achiamba, “Hiyu ni nabii dza viratu manabii anjina a kare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Herode ariphosikira kuhusu Jesu, waamba, “Hiye ni Johana nriyemkata chitswa, akafufuka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
