          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.19+LUK.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 3:19–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho awali Herode walagiza Johana agbwirwe na afungbwe jela. Wahenda hivyo kpwa mana Johana kala akamuambira kala chishariya ni makosa sana kumlóla Herodiya, ambaye kala ni mkpwaza nduguye Filipu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.17+MRK.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.17",
              "MRK.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Herodiya wamzira sana Johana achilonda kumuolaga. Ela washindwa kuhenda hivyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kpwa sababu Herode kala anamrinda. Herode wamuogopha Johana kpwa mana wamanya kukala ni mutu wa haki na asiye na lawama. Herode wamendza kumphundza, dzagbwe kala anayugika mwakpwe moyoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wakati wa kusherekeya kumbukumbu ya kuvyalwa kpwa Herode, Herodiya waphaha nafwasi. Siku iyo Herode waatayarishira karamu atumia a ngambiye, akulu a viha, na vilongozi a Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana mchetu wa Herodiya wakpwedzafwiha vinono mbere za hara atu, hata Herode na ajenie achihamirwa. Ndipho mfalume achimuamba yuya msichana, “Voya chochosi ulondacho nami nindakupha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achihendaapa achiamba, “Nindakupha chochosi ndichovoya, hata ikale ni nusu ya ufalume wangu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
